{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deadHex is a head-to-head tactical FPS meets MOBA, where every shot counts and every build tells a story. Battle to destroy your opponent\u2019s HQ in a game of precision, strategy, and brutal efficiency.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world of the Hamlet.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across different maps and themes as you cement your legacy as a Hexor. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the way you want to play.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is a 1v1 duel where you'll draft your build from hundreds of combinations\u2014balancing movement, firepower, durability, and Hex power. Whether you're a sharpshooter or a juggernaut, you decide how you win.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield powerful artifacts to shake up the battlefield.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merchants from far and wide come to provide their wares.  Harness the power of ancient artifacts that grant special abilities to dominate the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire mercenaries to wreak havoc on your opponents.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send in mercenaries\u2014elite units or overwhelming swarms\u2014to push the map and pressure enemy defenses. Timing and gold investment matter: a smart mercenary play can end the game before the next firefight even starts.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2184560?t=1763014820","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2184560?t=1763014820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184560/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763014820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184560/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763014820","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deadHex is a head-to-head tactical FPS meets MOBA, where every shot counts and every build tells a story. Battle to destroy your opponent\u2019s HQ in a game of precision, strategy, and brutal efficiency.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world of the Hamlet.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across different maps and themes as you cement your legacy as a Hexor. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the way you want to play.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is a 1v1 duel where you'll draft your build from hundreds of combinations\u2014balancing movement, firepower, durability, and Hex power. Whether you're a sharpshooter or a juggernaut, you decide how you win.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield powerful artifacts to shake up the battlefield.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merchants from far and wide come to provide their wares.  Harness the power of ancient artifacts that grant special abilities to dominate the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire mercenaries to wreak havoc on your opponents.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send in mercenaries\u2014elite units or overwhelming swarms\u2014to push the map and pressure enemy defenses. Timing and gold investment matter: a smart mercenary play can end the game before the next firefight even starts.</p>","developers":["Electrum Labs LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184560/header.jpg?t=1763014820","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2184560/1060945313/1c